> REVIEW: Missing main ingredient added without invented amount: gluten-free pizza crust

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @fresh mozzarella{3/2%oz} (torn into pieces), @shredded provolone cheese{2/3%oz}, @sliced calabrese salami (can substitute any spicy salami){2/3%oz}, @calabrian chile paste{2/3%tbsp} (plus more for serving), @pizza sauce{1/9%cup}, @gluten-free pizza crust{}.

== Preparation ==

Prepare the gluten-free crust according to package or linked source instructions.

Add sauce, cheese and toppings; bake until the crust is cooked and cheese is bubbling.
